      "nets": ["Net-(U8-Pad2)", "Net-(U8-Pad4)"],
      "observed": "U8 (74LVC1G34) input pin 2 is connected to U5.25 (UART_RXD0), and output pin 4 is connected to J7.3 (debug UART RX).",
      "expected": "The specification states J7 pin3→UART_RX (SKW92A pin 25). The buffer should be oriented so that J7.3 drives U5.25, or omitted.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"55\") (name \"Net-(U8-Pad2)\") (class \"Default\") (node (ref \"U5\") (pin \"25\") (pinfunction \"UART_RXD0\") (pintype \"bidirectional\")) (node (ref \"U8\") (pin \"2\") (pintype \"input\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"56\") (name \"Net-(U8-Pad4)\") (class \"Default\") (node (ref \"J7\") (pin \"3\") (pinfunction \"Pin_3\") (pintype \"passive\")) (node (ref \"U8\") (pin \"4\") (pintype \"output\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "J7 | Conn_01x03 | Debug UART header | netlist: pin1→GND, pin2→UART_TX (SKW92A pin 26), pin3→UART_RX (SKW92A pin 25)"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The debug UART RX line is driven from the module's RX input instead of driving it, so the module cannot receive serial data from the debug header.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "category": "footprint_mismatch",
      "components": ["C11"],
      "pins": ["C11.1", "C11.2"],
      "nets": ["unconnected-(C11-Pad1)", "GND"],
      "observed": "C11 is a 0.1uF capacitor (libsource Device:C) but its footprint is 'Inductor_SMD:L_0805_2012Metric_Pad1.05x1.20mm_HandSolder'. Pin 1 is on net 'unconnected-(C11-Pad1)' and pin 2 is on GND.",
      "expected": "A capacitor should use a capacitor footprint, and both pins should be connected to their intended nets (e.g., a power rail and GND).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(comp (ref \"C11\") (value \"0.1uF\") (footprint \"Inductor_SMD:L_0805_2012Metric_Pad1.05x1.20mm_HandSolder\") ... (libsource (lib \"Device\") (part \"C\") (description \"Unpolarized capacitor\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"60\") (name \"unconnected-(C11-Pad1)\") (class \"Default\") (node (ref \"C11\") (pin \"1\") (pintype \"passive\")))"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The capacitor cannot be assembled on the inductor footprint, and even if forced, it is not connected to any circuit node, so it provides no decoupling or function.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The design files contain several anomalies: C1 has the wrong value and voltage rating, U8 is wired backwards breaking the debug UART RX path, and C11 has an inductor footprint and an unconnected pin."
}

